WEBVTT

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.480
What could it be?"

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:04.696
So today,

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:07.256
100 years later,

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:11.496
I invite you all
on an incredible journey with me,

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:14.416
a 37-year-old Yale graduate and professor.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.576
(Cheers)

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:20.016
We will do nothing less
than use state-of-the-art technology

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.960
to map an entire country.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:26.696
This is a dream started by Hiram Bingham,

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:30.136
but we are expanding it to the world,